# Documentation

- User-facing changelogs: what users can now do, not internal implementation detail.
- Contributor notes go in a separate section or `docs/` paths.
- If generated docs exist, edit templates first, regenerate, commit both.
- Do not invent facts, metrics, or credentials; treat canonical source files as truth.

## Brainy doc map
- Vertical architecture: `docs/vertical/verticalization-model.md`
- Marketing discovery: `docs/vertical/marketing-use-case-map.md`
- Brand voice spec: `docs/vertical/marketing-brand-voice-spec.md`
- Mem0 parity: `docs/mem0-parity-matrix.md` (intentional deviations, not vague "Mem0-inspired")
- Execution contracts: `.omx/plans/v1-contracts-mem0-go-rebuild.md`
